  // (37 -> 1274 XHC1, 38 -> 1832 ANS, 39 -> 1292 XHC2, 47 -> 1198 COM0) plus the five MCA
  // audio translations. The boot USB controller's alias is bit-identical to
  // the ordinary table's, so the MCA table is a strict superset and the
  // boot path is untouched.
  //
  //   40 -> 1218  admac-sio, IRQ output index 1
